    post_json.py)      echo "  A POST not labeled JSON reaches the dispatcher again, or a stop is refused (review #25): do_POST must answer post_refusal (415, logged) before dispatch for any POST whose Content-Type is not application/json - except POST_ANY_TYPE (Stop, Pause) and an E-STOP that estop_wants_latch reads as a latch; the E-STOP route must read estop_wants_latch too (only on false or 0 releases); and no response may offer Access-Control-Allow-* (asv_console.py)." ;;
